# crypto.crc32 and crypto.fnv1a: checksums of the bytes of a text (values of the standard check string 123456789)
** spec: library/crypto.md
primary aspect c103_ids_hash is
  process main is
    print crypto.crc32("123456789"), crypto.crc32(""), crypto.crc32("a"), crypto.crc32("héllo");
    print crypto.fnv1a("hello"), crypto.fnv1a(""), crypto.fnv1a("a");
    print crypto.crc32("abc") == crypto.crc32("abc"), crypto.crc32("abc") <> crypto.crc32("abd");
  return;
end c103_ids_hash;
